# Runs the portable suite on Node.
#
# ci/js-build.hxml and ci/node-build.hxml prove CrossByte compiles for the
# browser and for Node. Compiling is not running, and the gap has already cost
# twice: ByteArray.__setData adopted an ArrayBuffer where the storage is a
# Uint8Array, so every read and write on js was broken while every js build
# stayed green. Reintroducing that bug turns this suite from 1013 passing
# assertions into 37 failures.
#
# Only cases needing no threads, no listening socket and no database are here;
# the rest of the suite still runs on cpp, interp and jvm.
-cp src
-cp tests
-lib utest
-lib hxnodejs
-main JsTestMain
--js export/js-tests/tests.js
--macro crossbyte.test.SuiteCoverage.check()
